# Contract template of a design studio: the "contract" example of stxt-pdf with Slots for what changes from one
# commission to another. The studio (its party, its signature, its footnotes) and the clauses are part of the template;
# the reference, the place and the date, the client, the purpose, the scope of the services, the deadlines, the fees
# and the schedule of the appendix come in the data, and so do the person who signs for the client and the image of
# their signature, which is optional. The scope is a Markdown list, written with the indentation of its levels, which
# goes into clause 2. contract.json has the sample data.
Document (dev.stxt.pdf):
	Page:
		Paper: A4
		Margin: 92 70 80 70
	Title: Design services agreement · ${reference}
	Language: en
	Section:
		Page overlay:
			Id: header
			Pages: not-first
			Offset: -60 0 auto 0
			Box:
				Padding: 0 0 6 0
				Border: 0 0 0.75 0
				Border color: indigo
			Stack:
				Horizontal: justify
				Vertical: end
				Item:
					Image: examples/contract/lumen.svg
						Alt: Lumen, design studio
						Box:
							Width: 78
				Item:
					Text: Design services agreement · Ref. ${reference}
		Page overlay:
			Id: footer
			Offset: auto 0 -48 0
			Box:
				Padding: 6 0 0 0
				Border: 0.5 0 0 0
				Border color: rule
			Stack:
				Horizontal: justify
				Vertical: end
				Item:
					Stack:
						Vertical: end
						Item:
							Text: Initials:
						Item:
							Block:
								Style: initials
						Item:
							Block:
								Style: initials
				Item:
					Text: Page {page} of {pages}
		Heading 1:
			Text: Design services agreement
			Typography:
				Numbered: false
		Text: ${place}, ${date}
			Typography:
				Align: center
				Italic: true
				Color: gray
			Box:
				Margin: 0 0 14 0
		Heading 2:
			Text: Parties
		Block:
			Id: parties
			Box:
				Margin: 0 0 8 0
			Block:
				Style: party
				Box:
					Margin: 0 0 8 0
				Paragraph:
					Content >>
						On the one hand, **Lumen Estudio de Diseño, S.L.P.**, Tax ID B-55123987, with registered address at Calle de la Ribera, 8, Olot (Girona), represented by Ms. Irene Calvo Mas, as its director[^poder] (hereinafter, “the Studio”).
			Block: {client}
				Style: party
				Paragraph:
					Content >>
						On the other hand, **${name}**, Tax ID ${tax_id}, with registered address at ${address}, represented by ${represented_by} (hereinafter, “the Client”).
		Paragraph: Both parties mutually acknowledge that they have the legal capacity required to enter into this agreement and, to that end,
		Heading 2:
			Text: Recitals
		List:
			Marker: upper-roman
			List item:
				Paragraph: <recital>
			List item:
				Paragraph: The Studio is professionally engaged in graphic and digital design and has the resources and experience required to carry out the commission.
			List item:
				Paragraph: Both parties wish to set the terms of the commission and therefore agree to enter into this contract under the clauses of section {number of: terms}, set out below
		Heading 2:
			Id: terms
			Text: Clauses
		Markdown:
			Id: clauses
			Number markers: decimal lower-alpha lower-roman
			Typography:
				Line breaking: optimal
			Content >>
				1. **Purpose.** The Studio undertakes to design and deliver to the Client ${purpose}, in accordance with the technical proposal of ${proposal_date}, which forms part of this contract as Appendix {number of: annex-title}.

				2. **Scope of services.** The services comprise:

				${scope}

				3. **Deadlines.** ${deadlines} Deadlines will be suspended for as long as the Client does not provide the materials or approvals for which it is responsible.

				4. **Fees and payment terms.** The fees amount to ${fees}, plus applicable VAT[^iva], payable according to the schedule in Appendix {number of: annex-title} by bank transfer within thirty days of the date of each invoice. Late payment will accrue the statutory interest set for commercial transactions.

				5. **Obligations of the Studio.** The Studio will carry out the commission with due professional diligence, appoint a person responsible for the relationship with the Client and report regularly on the progress of the work.

				6. **Obligations of the Client.** The Client will provide the necessary texts, images and data, appoint a contact person with decision-making authority and give its approval or comments within ten business days of each delivery.

				7. **Intellectual property.** Upon full payment of the fees, the Studio assigns to the Client, exclusively and worldwide, the exploitation rights to the logo and the other elements of the identity. The Studio may mention the work in its portfolio[^portafolio], unless expressly requested otherwise.

				8. **Confidentiality.** Each party will keep secret any confidential information of the other to which it has access by reason of the contract and will not use it for any other purpose, during its term and for the following five years.

				9. **Changes and additional work.** Any change to the scope, deadlines or fees must be made in writing and signed by both parties. Any work not included in Appendix {number of: annex-title} will be quoted separately.

				10. **Term and termination.** The contract will remain in force until the delivery and acceptance of the last of the deliverables. Either party may terminate it for serious breach by the other, after written notice and fifteen days to remedy the breach.

				11. **Data protection.** Each party will process any personal data it accesses in accordance with the applicable regulations and solely to perform this contract. If the Studio accesses data of ${data_of}, it will do so as data processor, under the corresponding agreement.

				12. **Governing law and jurisdiction.** This contract is governed by Spanish law. For any dispute, the parties submit to the courts of Olot, waiving any other jurisdiction that may apply to them.
		Footnote:
			Id: poder
			Paragraph: Under the power of attorney granted before the notary of Olot Mr. Marc Pujol Serra on May 12, 2021, number 1,204 of his records.
		Footnote:
			Id: iva
			Paragraph: At the general rate in force on the date of each invoice, 21% at the signing of this contract.
		Footnote:
			Id: portafolio
			Paragraph: On its website, on its social media and in entries for design awards, without disclosing confidential information of the Client.
		Block:
			Id: annex
			Break:
				Before: page
			Heading 1:
				Id: annex-title
				Style: annex
				Typography:
					Number label: Appendix {number} ·
				Text: Schedule and fees
			Table:
				Id: fees
				Column sizes: 36 * 84 74
				Column align: left left right right
				Box:
					Margin: 0 0 14 0
				Header rows:
					Row:
						Cell: No.
						Cell: Milestone and deliverable
						Cell: Expected date
						Cell: Amount
				Body rows:
					Row: [milestones]
						Cell: <number>
						Cell: <milestone>
							Row header: true
						Cell: <date>
						Cell: <amount>
				Footer rows:
					Row:
						Style: total
						Cell: Total excluding VAT
							Row header: true
							Span: 1 3
						Cell: <total>
		Block:
			Id: signatures
			Break:
				Keep together: true
			Paragraph: In witness whereof, the parties sign this contract in duplicate, to a single effect, at the place and on the date stated at the beginning.
			Grid:
				Column sizes: * *
				Gap: 30
				Box:
					Margin: 10 0 0 0
				Area:
					Block:
						Style: sign
						Text: For the Studio
							Typography:
								Bold: true
								Color: indigo
								Case: uppercase
								Letter spacing: 0.6
						Image: examples/certificate/signature-director.svg
							Alt: Signature of Irene Calvo Mas
							Box:
								Width: 130
								Margin: 4 0 0 0
						Block:
							Box:
								Border: 0.5 0 0 0
								Border color: ink
								Padding: 4 0 0 0
							Text: Irene Calvo Mas
							Text: Director, Lumen Estudio de Diseño, S.L.P.
				Area: {client}
					Block:
						Style: sign
						Text: For the Client
							Typography:
								Bold: true
								Color: indigo
								Case: uppercase
								Letter spacing: 0.6
						Image: <?signature>
							Alt: Signature of ${signer}
							Box:
								Width: 130
								Margin: 4 0 0 0
						Block:
							Box:
								Border: 0.5 0 0 0
								Border color: ink
								Padding: 4 0 0 0
							Text: <signer>
							Text: <signer_position>
